/*!
    \page index.html
    \title Ascent

    \e {Casino · 25 min · Intermediate}

    Ascent is a crash game: a balloon rises, a multiplier climbs with it, and at
    a moment nobody can predict the balloon pops. Cash out before it does and you
    keep your bet times the multiplier. Wait one tick too long and you keep
    nothing.

    This tutorial builds the whole game with Felgo, from an empty project to
    something you could publish - including the part most crash games gloss over:
    proving to the player that the outcome was fixed before the round started and
    was never influenced by their bet.
*/
